{"version":1,"content":"<p>尼泊爾中北部山區Gorkha周日（11日）爆發山洪。</p><p>法新社片段可見，山區洪水往下沖淹蓋民房。</p><p>估計當地約有35至40間房屋被沖走。</p><p>當局緊急呼籲村民疏散避難。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-11T11:18:08.414501+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":80,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-11T10:46:08+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T07:37:42.171017+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"e1d6958b0d16f3bd13b90420653e9e45a89f790d56519d4be189ea2daf19871e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}